<div class="wrap">
<h1>County profiles</h1>
<p class="lede">What does sea level rise and flooding mean for my jurisdiction? A profile for each of {{ cp.counties | length }} California counties, rebuilding the function of NOAA's discontinued Coastal County Snapshots. Every figure carries its vintage, and every gap says why it is a gap.</p>
<p class="hero-about-link">This tool is under development. Its pages currently show placeholder figures, not measurements.</p>
